    lessonText: "Jesus told the woman at the well that the Father is actively seeking true worshippers. That word \"seeking\" is remarkable — God is not passively waiting to receive worship. He is looking for it. He wants it from you.\n\n\"In spirit and in truth\" — both matter. Worship in spirit without truth becomes emotionalism. Worship in truth without spirit becomes religion: correct but cold, accurate but lifeless.\n\nWorship is not a 30-minute segment of the Sunday service. Worship is a posture — an orientation of your whole self toward God. Romans 12:1 calls it a \"living sacrifice\" — your daily life offered to God as an act of worship.",
