    lessonText: "The Son of God came to serve. That is not what anyone expected of the Messiah. Instead, Jesus washed feet, touched lepers, ate with outcasts, and said the greatest among you will be your servant.\n\nThis is not a personality type. This is a calling for every follower of Jesus. Galatians 5:13 does not say \"if you are gifted for service, serve.\" It says \"by love serve one another\" — full stop.\n\nService is not a program you sign up for. It is a posture you cultivate. It means walking into a room and asking \"what needs to be done?\" instead of \"what can I get out of this?\" Jesus modeled what it looks like to be the most powerful person in the room and still be the one holding the towel.",
