    lessonText: "Tithing is the first 10% of your income returned to God through the local church. It is the only place in Scripture where God tells you to test Him — \"prove me now herewith.\" He is making a direct challenge and a direct promise: bring the tithe, and watch what happens.\n\n2 Corinthians 9:7 gives the spirit of generosity: give as you have purposed in your heart. Cheerfully, not reluctantly. Freely, not under compulsion.\n\nGenerosity is not fundamentally about money. It is about the condition of your heart toward God and others. A generous person has settled the question of ownership: God owns it all, and I am a steward.",
